      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "STARBRIGHT HUD (4) has a strong winning strike-rate over this track and trip with two wins and a placing from three tries. In the money last time at Ballarat (25.58) in a Grade 5, finishing a 2 length second. With a clean break looks hard to beat. ULTRA PUB RUN (3) is a capable type and proved too strong last time to win by a neck at this track in a handy 25.94 beating Mr. Bluey Lee. The form from his last run stacks up well. Bold showing expected again. PERFECT TONIGHT (7) jumped from a low draw and boxed on well to finish third last time, beaten one length (25.89) behind Paw Nevada at Ballarat. Expected to be in the finish again. ADHANA ROY (1) placed last time out at big odds - worth considering.",
